63,65,83,22],[32257,30.5,1956,65,88,24]],"links":[["Bayfield County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/wisconsin/bayfield-county"],["ARC or PLC in Bayfield County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/bayfield-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Bayfield County runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle saw October to November at 57% and August to September at 62%. Grid 31354 had its driest year in 1976 at 53%.</p>"}
